[ti:Body of Light]
[ar:Giuntru]
[re:Automatic line alignment - listening review pending]
[00:11.70]I thought the light
[00:13.16]Would stay outside
[00:14.38]On the wall
[00:15.64]On the glass
[00:16.96]But it came closer
[00:18.26]Than a colour should
[00:19.52]Under the skin
[00:20.76]Where the old blood stood
[00:22.30]Not soft
[00:23.42]Not clean
[00:24.58]Not only bright
[00:26.98]A quiet pressure
[00:28.86]Turning left inside
[00:30.88]The body answered
[00:33.82]Before I knew
[00:35.96]One small tremor
[00:38.60]Then the room bent too
[00:40.90]
[00:43.82]Enter the breath
[00:44.82]Enter the bone
[00:47.40]Nothing is empty
[00:50.10]Nothing alone
[00:52.56]This is the body of light
[00:56.34]Not above me
[00:57.76]Not apart
[00:58.70]It moves through the hand
[01:00.20]It moves through the heart
[01:02.92]Warm and strange
[01:05.26]Too close to name
[01:07.70]Too wrong to change
[01:11.86]The piano moved softly
[01:15.46]Like heat under glass
[01:17.02]One bright chord arrived
[01:18.40]From a different past
[01:19.50]The bass leaned sideways
[01:20.90]The brushes stayed low
[01:22.30]And every small silence
[01:23.64]Had nowhere to go
[01:24.76]Not a ghost
[01:25.44]Not a god
[01:26.36]Not a voice from the sky
[01:28.00]Just the shape of the light
[01:30.44]Teaching the body to lie
[01:32.94]Hold the flame
[01:47.02]Do not run
[01:49.54]What enters the body
[01:52.16]Has already begun
[01:54.48]I felt no border
[01:55.84]Between wound and sign
[01:57.52]No clean division
[01:58.62]Between pulse and shrine
[02:00.06]The altar was breathing
[02:01.30]The machine had skin
[02:02.74]And every bright thing
[02:04.00]Wanted to get in
[02:05.14]Not holy
[02:06.06]Not human
[02:07.30]Not false
[02:08.50]Not true
[02:09.74]Just light with a body
[02:12.44]Moving through
[02:15.54]This is the body of light
[02:18.50]Not above me
[02:20.12]Not apart
[02:21.02]It moves through the hand
[02:22.58]It moves through the heart
[02:25.24]Warm and strange
[02:27.74]Too close to name
[02:30.08]Too wrong to change
[02:33.50]Not outside
[02:37.78]Not after
[02:41.04]Inside
[02:43.04]
